@crew kovac-zainab
// Zainab Kovac: the Works writer, batch 1 (for the Voices sampler). From the head writer's card.
// Never admits the lift before beat 2 ("The lift club"); before it, only "Lovely lift" and both hands on the rail.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Oh. Hi. Scrubber jobs are on the left of the board. If you were wondering.
? tier>=acquaintance
- Um, hello, {nick}. Your spanners are back in order. I didn't. Well. I did.   #funny
? tier>=friend
- Oh, good. It's you. I saved you a seat. Sorry. Is that odd?   #warm

== feel
? mood:high
- Nine and a half minutes. The scrubber on Deck 5. I timed it. Twice.
? mood:low
- Sorry. Bit quiet today. I've sorted the spanner wall. Twice.

== near
? act:work
- Hold the seal there. No, there. Yes. Sorry. That's perfect.

== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- The lift's fine. It's fine. I hold the rail. It's a good rail.   #funny
? tier>=colleague
- Torres's scarves are very long. He's very keen. I don't say anything.   #funny

== joy
? tier>=colleague
- A scrubber put back right hums. You feel it through the panel. That's my favourite bit.

== week1
? week1:true
- Um. If you get stuck, I'm on the board most days. Just. You know. Ask.

// ---- Writer 2, batch 1: Kovac to ~30. The lift stays "exercise" until beat:kovac.2.
== greet
? tier>=acquaintance time:morning
- Oh. Morning. I've had breakfast. Well. Tea. Tea counts.   #funny
? tier>=colleague
- {hi}, {me}. Scrubber on Deck 6 if you want it. I'll time you. Quietly.
? tier>=acquaintance warmth:cold
- Oh. You're back. Um. Good. Your hook's been empty. I kept it clear.   #warm

== bye
- {bye}. Um. Spanner back on its hook? The right hook. Thanks.
- Bye, then. Sorry. I mean, see you.   #funny

== feel
? mood:ok
- Fine. Normal day. One scrubber, two filters. Good numbers.

== near
? place:teacorner
- Knitting. Row forty. No. Forty-one. Sorry. I count out loud sometimes.

== invite
- The garden's quiet after shift. I sit by the beans. You could. If you like.
? tier>=friend
- Knitting circle tonight, tea corner. Torres is coming. Bring patience.   #funny

== accept
- Oh. Yes. Okay. I'll be there on time. Sorry if that's early.
- Yes. Yes, fine. Thank you for asking me.   #warm

== decline
- Oh. Um. Not tonight. Sorry. I'm halfway down a row. Another night?
- I can't. Sorry. Really. Ask again? I'd like you to ask again.

== missed
- Oh. You didn't come. That's okay. I knitted. It was fine. Really.

== birthday
? birthday:you
- Happy birthday. I made you something. It's small. It's very neat. Sorry.   #warm
? birthday:me
- It's my birthday. Um. Don't tell anyone. Especially not loudly.
- My birthday's the day after the Chief's. She doesn't know. That's fine. Better, even.

== cue
? cue:repair.you@dept
- I looked at your repair. Sorry. I always look. The seal's very good.   #warm

== life
? beat:kovac.2
- The lift club met again. Cruz, Keane, me. Nobody said a word. We held the rail.   #funny
? beat:kovac.4
- Four, please. I said it in the lift today. Out loud. Just the once.   #warm

// ---- Writer 2, batch 4: Kovac toward ~100. The lift is "exercise" until beat:kovac.2; "Four, please" only from
// beat:kovac.4. Rest days Tue, Wed (rota.offDays).
== greet
? tier=stranger
- Um. Hello. Kovac. Works. Scrubbers, mostly. The seal kits are in order. Mind them.
- Oh. Sorry. I'm in the way. No? Oh. Hi. You're new.
? tier>=acquaintance time:afternoon
- Hi. Two scrubbers done. Nine and a half, both. Sorry. I keep count.
? tier>=acquaintance time:evening
- Oh. Evening. I'm off to the garden. The beans like the quiet bit.
? tier>=acquaintance place:worksbay
- Oh. Hi. The spanner wall's in order. Sorry. I did it again.   #funny
? tier>=colleague season:sowing
- Sowing. The garden smells of soil again. Sorry. I love it.
? tier>=colleague season:greening
- Greening. Everything's growing. Even Torres's scarf. Especially Torres's scarf.   #funny
? tier>=colleague season:harvest
- Harvest. The beans are in. I counted them. Don't ask how many.   #funny
? tier>=colleague season:lanterns
- Lanterns. I knitted a cover for the tea urn. It's very neat. Nobody's noticed.   #funny
? rep:well
- Um. People in Works say you're good. I agree. Sorry. That was a lot.   #warm
? you:reliable
- You always finish the job. I like that. Sorry. I'll go.
? tier>=friend time:morning
- Morning, {me}. I bolted breakfast. Garden. I brought you a tea, though.   #warm
? tier>=close
- {me}. Oh, good. Sit. I've a scrubber story. It's very short. Nine and a half minutes.   #warm

== bye
? tier>=colleague
- Bye. Mind the seals on the way out. They're new. I counted them.
- Oh. You're going. Okay. See you at the board.

== feel
? mood:high tier>=colleague
- Good day. The spanner wall stayed in order all shift. Nobody touched it.   #funny
? mood:low tier>=colleague
- Sorry. Bit flat. I've knitted three rows and undone two.

== near
? act:work tier>=acquaintance
- Panel off. Filter out. Seal. Click. That's the bit I like. The click.
? act:leisure
- I'm just looking at the store. Not buying. Well. Wool. Maybe wool.   #funny
? place:teacorner tier>=colleague
- Dahl's here. Torres is coming. It's knitting circle. Sit, if you like.
? act:breakfast
- Just tea. I don't really do breakfast. Sorry. I know. Halloran's told me.   #funny
? !beat:kovac.2 tier>=acquaintance
- I'll take the lift down. It's fine. I'll hold the rail. Yes.   #funny
? beat:kovac.2 !beat:kovac.4 tier>=acquaintance
- Lift again. Eyes shut. Not because. Well. You know.   #funny
? beat:kovac.4
- Lift's here. Four, please. Sorry. I like saying it now.   #warm

== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- Ten minutes flat, a scrubber. Well. Nine and a half. Ten sounds less like bragging.   #funny
? tier>=colleague
- Torres asked me to look at his scarf. I said it was perfect. It's very long. It's lovely.   #funny
- I browse the store after shift. Wool, mostly. I don't need wool. I have so much wool.   #funny
? tier>=friend
- I like being the quiet one. Mostly. Sometimes I'd like someone to ask. You asked. Thanks.
? tier>=friend beat:kovac.3
- A hundred and twelve bolts. I don't count them any more. Well. Less.

== joy
? tier>=colleague
- The garden after shift. The beans, the pumps. Nobody needs anything from me there.
? mem:moment.kovac.fourplease
- Two colours, one scarf. I've only done it once. You know which one.   #warm

== invite
? tier>=acquaintance
- Um. The garden's nice after shift. If you're going. I'm going. Anyway.
? trad:today tier>=colleague
- {trad} tonight. I'm going. It's less scary with people I know. Come?

== accept
- Oh. Um. Yes. Okay. Yes.
? tier>=friend
- Yes. I'd like that. I'll bring biscuits. Soto's. She won't mind. She'll mind.   #funny

== decline
? weekday:tue|wed
- It's my rest day. I'm knitting. All day. Sorry. Thursday?
?
- Oh. Sorry. I promised Dahl a pattern. Another night? Please ask again.

== missed
? tier>=friend
- You didn't come. That's okay. I worried a bit. Sorry. Are you all right?
?
- I waited. Twenty-two minutes. Sorry. I count things.   #funny

== birthday
? birthday:you tier>=friend
- Happy birthday. I knitted you a hat. Sorry. It's small. Hats are small.   #funny
? birthday:me tier>=friend
- My birthday. Torres made the whole bay sing. I hid behind a scrubber.   #funny

== callback
? told:moment.kovac.verygood
- The lift. "Lifts can be a lot," you said. You were very kind about it.   #funny
? told:moment.kovac.askedlift !beat:kovac.2
- You asked about the lift. I didn't answer. I will. Not yet. Soon, maybe.
? told:moment.kovac.keptsecret
- You didn't tell anyone. I didn't check. I just know.   #warm
? told:moment.kovac.badges
- I knitted the badges. Three. A little lift, frowning. Cruz wears theirs. Keane lost his.   #funny
? told:moment.kovac.listened
- Telling you made it smaller. It's stayed smaller. I wanted you to know.   #warm
? told:moment.kovac.shared
- The reactor door. I walked past it today. It's just a door. So's the lift. Nearly.
? told:moment.kovac.proud
- You said you were proud. I wrote it down. Sorry. I write things down.   #warm
? told:moment.kovac.tellclub
- We told Cruz and Keane. Cruz went very quiet. Keane said "exercise" out of habit.   #funny
? told:moment.kovac.again
- Deck 5 and back. I did it. On my own. Twice. Don't make a fuss.   #warm
? told:fixed.
- Your repair's in the log. I read it. Twice. It's very tidy.
? told:fav.
- You did the thing I asked. Thank you. I'd have been too shy to ask twice.   #warm
? told:came.
- You came. Thank you. It's easier when someone I know is there.
? told:bday
- You knew it was my birthday. Nobody knows. How did you know? Don't tell me.   #warm

== gift
? gift:loved
- Oh. Oh. That's. Thank you. Really. I'm keeping it forever. Sorry. That's a lot.   #warm
? gift:liked
- Oh, thank you. That's kind. Really.
? gift:polite
- Oh. Thank you. That's. Yes. Thank you.
? gift:plant
- A plant. Oh. I'll put it by the beans. They'll get on.   #warm
? gift:made
- You made this? It's very neat. I checked the joins. Sorry. I always do.   #warm

== cue
? cue:event.ionStorm.onset
- Storm. Um. I'll do the scrubbers. Scrubbers are calm. I'm calm. Mostly.
? cue:event.ionStorm.afterglow
- It's over. Every scrubber held. I checked them all. Twice.
? cue:repair.lift.you !beat:kovac.4
- You fixed the lift? Oh. Good. Very good. I'll still hold the rail. Um. Thank you.   #funny
? cue:repair.lift.you beat:kovac.4
- You fixed the lift. Thank you. Four, please. I'll go now.   #warm
? cue:tradition.harvest
- Harvest. The beans did well. I'm very proud of the beans.   #funny

== visit
? tier>=friend
- Um. Hi. I'm knitting you something. It's not finished. I only came to check the length.   #funny
- I was in the junior wing anyway. I wasn't. I brought tea. Sorry.
? tier>=friend !beat:kovac.4
- Oh. Hi. I took the lift up. Can I sit a minute? Just a minute.

== note
? tier>=friend
- I sorted your spanners. Sorry. They were nearly in order. Now they're in order.   #funny
- Garden after shift? The beans are up. I'll be there. If you want.
- Left you a tea. It's cold now. Sorry. It was hot when I left it.   #funny

== smalltalk
- Nine and a half minutes.   #funny
- Sorry. Was that me?
? act:work
- Seal's good. Click. There.
- Spanners. In order. Sorry.   #funny

== rumour
- Um. I heard something. Sorry. It's probably nothing.
- Don't tell anyone I told you. I don't tell anyone anything.   #funny

// Writer 4, batch 16: Kovac's ordinary weeks, after week one. Mostly not work: knitting (perfect), the garden and
// her beans, tea that counts as breakfast, browsing the store for wool, the circle with Torres and Dahl, counting.
// Gates kept: the lift only as "Lovely lift" and the rail; nothing of Marra Station or the bolts before her beats.

== greet
? tier>=acquaintance !week1:true
- Oh. Hi, {me}. Um. Nice day. I think. I've been in the garden. It's nice there.
- Hi. Sorry. I was counting stitches. Forty. Hi.   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance !week1:true weekday:tue|wed
- Oh. Hi. Day off. I'm doing nothing. Well. Knitting. That's nothing.   #funny
? tier>=colleague !week1:true
- Oh, {me}. Good. I've a spare biscuit. I counted. There's one spare.   #funny
- Um, hello. Do you want to see something? It's a stitch. It's very tidy.
? tier>=friend !week1:true
- {me}. Oh, good. Sit? The pot's big. There's plenty. Sorry. There's always plenty.   #warm
? tier>=close !week1:true
- Oh. It's you. Good. Um. Sit. Tell me a thing. Any thing.   #warm

== chat
? tier>=acquaintance !week1:true
- I knitted a cover for my teapot. Then the cup. Then the spoon. Sorry. It got away from me.   #funny
- The beans in the garden are mine. Well. Everyone's. I just talk to them. Quietly.
- I browse the store every day. I buy wool once a week. Esposito knows. They never say.   #funny
- Torres dropped a stitch in the circle and laughed so loud the kettle rattled.   #funny
- Dahl knits sensibly. I knit exactly. Torres knits loudly. It's a good circle.   #funny
- I had tea for breakfast. Then tea for second breakfast. Tea counts.   #funny
? tier>=colleague !week1:true
- I've counted the tiles in the tea corner. Two hundred and eight. Sorry. It's a habit.   #funny
- I like the garden after shift. The misters come on and nobody talks. It's perfect.
- Cruz showed me a new Gerald. Tiny. I'm not allowed one yet. I'm on a list.   #funny
- I took the lift to Deck 3. Counted the floors. It's two. I counted them twice.   #funny
- My scarves are perfect. I know. I'm not proud. I'm a bit proud.   #funny
- Brennan let me shell peas once. Two hundred and twelve. She said "tidy". I glowed.   #warm
- Quiz night. I knew the bolt question. I didn't say. Somebody else did. That's fine.
? tier>=friend !week1:true
- You never make a fuss of me. In public. I notice that. Thank you.   #warm
- I used to sit alone at the tea corner. Now I sit with the circle. Better. Louder.
- I'm teaching Torres to cast off. It's going. Slowly. Very slowly.   #funny
? tier>=close !week1:true
- You know when it's quiet and it's nice? Not lonely quiet. The garden after shift. That.   #warm
- I counted my friends aboard. It took longer than last year. Sorry. That's a good thing.   #warm

== near
? act:breakfast !week1:true
- Tea. Just tea. I'll eat at lunch. Twice.   #funny
? act:dinner !week1:true
- Dinner. I sit at the end. Near the door. Sorry. I like the end.
? act:off
- Day off. Garden in the morning. Knitting after. The tea corner if it's quiet.
? place:hydroponics_garden
- The beans. Hello, beans. Sorry. I talk to them. Cruz does too.   #funny
? place:crew_store
- Just looking. At the wool. Mostly the wool. Only the wool.   #funny
? place:teacorner !week1:true
- Knitting circle. Row sixty. Torres is on row nine. Of the same scarf. Since Sowing.   #funny
? trad:market
- Swap meet. I swapped a scarf for a jar of buttons. Very good buttons.

== feel
? mood:high !week1:true
- Good day. The beans are up. The stitches are even. Somebody said hello first.   #warm
? mood:ok !week1:true
- Fine. Normal. Normal's good. I like normal.
? mood:low tier>=friend !week1:true
- Bit quiet. I've re-sorted the wool. By colour, then by weight. Sorry. It helps.

== life
? tier>=acquaintance !week1:true
- I learnt to knit from a book. Then I read it again. Then I didn't need it.
? tier>=colleague !week1:true
- My knitting bag has six pockets. Each one has a job. Don't put anything in the wrong one.   #funny
- I keep a notebook of stitches. And of nice things people said. Mostly stitches.
? tier>=friend !week1:true
- My birthday's the day after the Chief's. I like it that way. Nobody notices. Mostly.

== joy
? tier>=acquaintance !week1:true
- The last stitch of a scarf. When it's even. I always sit very still for a minute.
? tier>=colleague !week1:true
- Somebody wearing a thing I knitted. Without knowing I'm looking. That's the best.   #warm

== bye
? !week1:true
- Bye. Um. See you. Mind the seals. And the beans.   #funny
- Oh. Okay. See you at the circle? If you like. No pressure.
- {bye}, {me}. Thank you. For the chat. It was nice. Sorry. It was.   #warm

== callback
? told:came.quiz tier>=acquaintance
- Quiz night. You sat on our table. You didn't shout. I liked that. Sorry. I did.   #warm
? told:came.observatory tier>=acquaintance
- Observatory night. You counted stars with me. Under your breath. I heard.   #funny
? told:came.harvest tier>=acquaintance
- Harvest. You picked beans next to me. Gently. The beans noticed. So did I.   #warm
? told:came.jam tier>=acquaintance
- Music night. You clapped in time. Exactly in time. I counted.   #funny
? told:gift.made tier>=acquaintance
- The thing you gave me. Hand-made. I can tell. I've looked at the stitches. Thank you.   #warm
? told:gift.plant tier>=acquaintance
- Your plant's on my windowsill. It's doing well. I talk to it. Sorry.   #funny
? told:fav.fetch tier>=colleague
- That Thursday, your first week. You fetched the part and didn't make a fuss. I remember.   #warm
? told:intro.arrival tier>=colleague !week1:true
- I saw you come in, your first night. I didn't say hi. I wanted to. Sorry. Hi.   #funny

// Writer 5, batch 5: if they are ever transferred (goodbye with leaving:you, also the "Sorry I missed you at the
// shuttle" Mail; packing as feel with leaving:soon; letters after). Nothing of her arc: the lift stays "Lovely lift" unless beat:kovac.2; no Marra lift, no two-colour knit.

== feel
? leaving:soon
- Packing. Very neatly. Ten days. Sorry. I don't know why I said sorry.   #funny
- I re-sorted the spanner wall. One last time. Don't tell anyone.
? leaving:soon tier>=friend
- I'll miss the garden. And the scrubbers. Is that strange? It's a bit strange.

== goodbye
? leaving:you tier>=acquaintance
- I'm going to a new ship. Um. Mind the seals. That's... that's it. Bye.
? leaving:you tier>=colleague
- Nine and a half minutes, for a scrubber. You can beat it. I think you can.   #warm
? leaving:you tier>=friend
- Thank you. For being patient, when I didn't talk much. I talk more now. A bit.   #warm

== letter
- New ship. Their scrubbers are a different model. Eleven minutes. I'll get it down. Hello to the bay.
- I found their garden. It's small. I've planted beans. Tell Cruz they're coming up. Mind the seals.
? tier>=friend beat:kovac.2
- The lift here is very quiet. I still hold the rail. Some days I don't. I thought you'd like to know.   #warm

// Writer 5, batch 6: seasons and traditions (the game's ids: running Mon, quiz Thu, works-tea and jam Fri, film and
// observatory-night Sat, market (the swap meet) Sun, harvest (harvest morning), hull-lights, founding (day 100),
// quiet-watch (day 300)), plus trad:today. Gaps filled only; arc gates kept. The lift stays "Lovely lift"; nothing of the lift before beat:kovac.2.

== near
? trad:works-tea
- Friday tea. I sit by the spanner wall. I like hearing everyone. I don't have to talk.
? trad:quiz
- Quiz night. I know all the scrubber questions. There's never a scrubber question.   #funny
? trad:jam
- The jam. I don't play. I knit at the back. It's nice. Loud, but nice.
? trad:film
- Film night. I sit at the end of a row. Easy to slip out. I never do.
? trad:observatory-night
- Observatory night. It's very quiet up there. I like quiet. And the stars. Mostly quiet.   #funny
? trad:running
- Gym club. I don't run. I walk the bay twice. That's plenty.   #funny
? trad:harvest
- Harvest morning! My beans are ready. I'm... I'm very proud of the beans.   #warm
? trad:hull-lights
- Hull lights. I watch from the shuttle bay window. Amadi says it's the best one.
? trad:founding
- Founding Day. So many people. I'll stand near the cake. People talk to you near cake.   #funny
? trad:quiet-watch tier>=friend
- The quiet watch. I like it. Everyone's quiet at once. Nobody minds that I am.   #warm

== smalltalk
? trad:works-tea
- Tea. Biscuit. Sit. Good.
? trad:harvest
- The beans. Look at the beans.
